flowchart TD
    A[CLI Entry Point run_pipeline.py] --> B{Validate Arguments}
    B -->|Invalid| FAIL1[Error: Directory not found]
    B -->|Valid| C[Configure Logging]
    
    C --> D[Initialize ADI Processor]
    D --> E[Scan PDF Directory]
    E --> F{PDFs Found?}
    
    F -->|No| FAIL2[Exit: No PDFs]
    F -->|Yes| G[Process Each PDF]
    
    G --> H[Load Config]
    H --> I[ADI Extraction]
    
    I --> J[Extract Structure]
    J --> K1[Generate Markdown]
    J --> K2[Extract Tables]
    J --> K3[Generate Metadata]
    
    K1 --> L[Save to Output Directory]
    K2 --> L
    K3 --> L
    
    L --> M{More PDFs?}
    M -->|Yes| G
    M -->|No| N[Complete Processing]
    
    N --> END[End: Pipeline Complete]
    
    %% Error handling path
    J -->|Error| ERR[Log Error & Continue]
    ERR --> M